ion above target and risks from U.S. tariffs and domestic political uncertainty."}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"post-social","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"social-list d-flex align-items-center","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"href":"/#","title":"facebook","className":"facebook","children":["$","i",null,{"className":"lab la-facebook-f"}]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"href":"/#","title":"twitter","className":"twitter","children":["$","i",null,{"className":"lab la-twitter"}]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"href":"/#","title":"linkedin","className":"linkedin","children":["$","i",null,{"className":"lab la-linkedin-in"}]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"href":"/#","title":"instagram","className":"instagram","children":["$","i",null,{"className":"lab la-instagram"}]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L11",null,{"href":"/#","title":"pinterest","className":"pinterest","children":["$","i",null,{"className":"lab la-pinterest-p"}]}]}]]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"col-lg-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"post-layout-content","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"layout-thumb mb-30","children":["$","$L12",null,{"title":"Japan’s central bank holds steady on key interest rate","src":"/images/japan-boj-rate-hold.webp","alt":"Japan’s central bank holds steady on key interest rate","width":1200,"height":800,"priority":true,"style":{"width":"100%","height":"auto"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"layout-desc","style":{"marginBottom":"1rem"},"children":"Japan’s central bank kept its key interest rate unchanged at 0. 5% Friday, in a decision that was widely expected, given recent inflation trends that have stayed above target.  The Bank of Japan issued its decision on the overnight call rate after a two-day meeting by its policy board.  “Japan’s economy has recovered moderately, although some weakness has been seen in part.  Overseas economies have grown moderately on the whole,” it said in a statement.  The U."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"layout-desc","style":{"marginBottom":"1rem"},"children":"S.  Federal Reserve cut its policy rate by 0. 25 percentage points earlier this week, the Fed’s first cut since December, and lowered its short-term rate to about 4. 1%, down from 4. 3%.  Japan had been ailing from deflationary trends in recent years, but prices are gradually rising."}],"$L13","$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16"]}]}],"$L17"]}]]}]}],"$L18"]}]}]]
